    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27476" root="طيف" body-key="T">
    
      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طيّف</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَطْيِيفٌ</span>, <i>He went round</i> or
<i>round about,</i> or <i>circuited, much,</i> or <i>often;</i> as also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طوّف</span>: (K:) but, (TA,) IDrd says, ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اطاف</span></b> 
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طيّف</span> and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تطيّف</span></b>  are the same in meaning:
(O, TA:) therefore what is said in the K
requires consideration: ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تطيّف</span></b>  signifies as above.
(TA.)

